# SECURITY NOTICE:
# To prevent secrets from being inlined into public client-side browser bundles,
# API keys are NOT read from build-time environment variables (VITE_*_API_KEY).
# API keys must only be supplied by the user at runtime via the settings modal
# (Cloud AI Configuration Modal) and are stored in sessionStorage for the active tab only.
#
# Free Gemini API key: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Google Gemini (Default recommended: gemini-3.8-flash / gemini-2.0-flash)
# Enter via Settings Modal in Caregiver Portal -> Cloud AI Config

